{"doc_id": "doc23087", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Dylan Massett, played by Max Thieriot, is Norma's estranged son and Norman's half-brother. Having spent much of his youth independently, he is known for his resourcefulness and strong will. Despite his difficulties with Norma, Dylan genuinely cares for Norman and tries to encourage him to live outside the motel. He becomes involved in the town's marijuana trade and quickly climbs the ranks. However, his world collapses when Norma reveals that his conception resulted from an incestuous encounter, making Caleb his biological father. This discovery leads Dylan to distance himself from the family. In the second season finale, he reconnects with his mother and brother. By season three, Dylan is deeply worried about Norman's actions and attempts to get Norma to seek help. He also helps mend the relationship between Norma and Caleb, after reconnecting with his father, Caleb, and establishing his own legal medicinal marijuana farm following a DEA raid that destroyed the town's illicit trade. Throughout the season, Dylan grows close to Emma as she helps care for Norman, and he tries to raise funds for her lung transplant. Eventually, Dylan leaves White Pine Bay with Emma, whom he marries and has a child with. He later discovers online that Norma committed suicide and is angry Norman withheld this information. Upon returning, Norman confesses to a murder, but Dylan cannot bear to listen at his brother's trial. After Norman is released, Dylan finds him in the kitchen with Norma's corpse. A confrontation ensues where Norman tries to stab Dylan, but he is fatally shot by his brother. Dylan then returns to Seattle to be with Emma and their daughter.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 1460443508, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "938a28c13c689bf3fdfcba72bbe6b3e74ede0d809a20725c4f43228e9634e232", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Norma's brother, Caleb", "matched_aliases": ["Norma's brother, Caleb"], "query_id": "test650", "question_hash": "f75c55d000f851502f1067209f7c22b80a41ac4b2e553620ff97f9dd3b77492e", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 0, "row_hash": "6369fb9cd3cfa4d3b15bf3810d3bce615c49c14770f8bdfb5ee46b5767fa5718", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1074533317, "similarity": 0.06413365669630827, "source_content_hash": "9f372643dbda86a468a5d11da4fc0d346efa49d4d556560ecd5ec90703d42ca1", "source_hash": "ae5888d4b5e411921e665d1a41218e74119b93c09a0e3ce7a417a9eaa7bc4b86", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "16c5da011d452c588b7235bafe17a088d38b62458c6883541614ec53889564c9", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
