{"doc_id": "doc52772", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "The climate of Nigeria is significantly influenced by the Intertropical Convergence Zone (ITCZ) and monsoon winds. Rainfall patterns are marked by two main seasons: the first, associated with the north easterlies, begins in central Nigeria around April. The second major period of rainfall is brought by the Southwest monsoons, which arrive from the south atlantic ocean in July. These monsoons introduce high humidity, heavy cloud cover, and substantial rainfall, which can occur daily. This phase of increased precipitation lasts throughout the period until September, after which the monsoons gradually retreat southward.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 1115429074, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.3}, {"attempt": 2, "generated_text": "The monsoon winds from the South Atlantic Ocean arrive in central Nigeria in July, bringing high humidity, heavy cloud cover, and significant rainfall, which can occur daily. These monsoons gradually retreat southward towards the southern part of Nigeria until September. Rainfall totals in central Nigeria vary considerably, ranging from 1,100 mm (43.3 in) in the lowlands of the river Niger Benue trough to over 2,000 mm (78.7 in) along the south western escarpment of the Jos Plateau. The two dominant airmasses in Nigeria are the Maritime tropical (south westerlies) and the Continental tropical (north easterlies).", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 1960784918, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.5}], "fingerprint": "5274586ca137238294f2602c51238209134dc0c70b0f26b92cbd0a99b91db253", "generation_attempts": 3, "gold_answer": "till September", "matched_aliases": ["till September"], "query_id": "test1484", "question_hash": "38aa07798e8a6ffd4cd7e9132d9b09e4c2196e0ad97468fcf4eb73d8acce409d", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 0, "row_hash": "2100307adc2f0093079bf735f1d2fbed7323a780d44939a3d0b6ad5161728652", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1731917009, "similarity": 0.19829424307036247, "source_content_hash": "1a230fe4d27a63788b6ba2d5f16af03a9d88e6deadc1ad3cfeaf53c866f99660", "source_hash": "3771047755610a3f43e35ea721120c27e6ed0905234bf6faa90612b13accbf64", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.7, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "c948e2e5866358a890eed90fffd68f0038bdec382960ba19d8a5977b55af79b6", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
