{"doc_id": "doc60323", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Robert Lee Griffin III (born February 12, 1990), nicknamed RG3 or RGIII, is an American football quarterback who is currently a free agent. He played college football at Baylor, where he won the 2011 Heisman Trophy. He was drafted by the Washington Redskins second overall in the first round of the 2012 NFL Draft.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 117604997, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}, {"attempt": 2, "generated_text": "Robert Lee Griffin III, known as RGIII or RG3, was born on February 12, 1990. Before turning professional, he earned a notable award during his college football career at Baylor University, winning the Heisman Trophy in 2011. Griffin was selected second overall by the Washington Redskins in the first round of the 2012 NFL Draft. As of now, his status is that of a free agent.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 2080143621, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.5}], "fingerprint": "8ef32fb93a182ceef9d698c3a1893fdb16f108fab612339726f311ce7122d7a0", "generation_attempts": 3, "gold_answer": "currently a free agent", "matched_aliases": ["currently a free agent"], "query_id": "test1700", "question_hash": "7ba6cea096f9a7d1d27c0b95996de600ba80173ad253c59015e22e19f544a457", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 0, "row_hash": "6d3a7b08d66c7bab6694d85205450b4e6bd6ed2c40f91b69b5cabab61ab99874", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1077620077, "similarity": 0.8959731543624161, "source_content_hash": "751680ddda05db4c2a9fec397be5d34c2d7b2fbe6e4c9fe41cc8d190b143d4cb", "source_hash": "5e0e92ff9dc7922e3a2eac313c15418973677627608d5a7840845ed49b1f9da6", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.7, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "fd827d30c474a8b77a3364c95d52f467f0c7c6aded751491f4dd1408b0bcd317", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_al